\p{Derivation (\code{\verb~|set-timeouts.py~}): budget = 3 × Σ official wall time, distributed as \code{\verb~|c·w^0.6~} over \code{\verb~|compare-perf~} tests (\code{\verb~|w~} ≥ 1 s), rounded up to 10 s; ≈ 2× official for mathlib. They are re-derived from time to time; expect them to shrink when the official kernel gets faster.}
}

