\p{For reference — tenet-jvm: \code{\verb~|bugs/nat-shift-huge~} → \code{\verb~|java.lang.OutOfMemoryError: GC overhead limit exceeded~} after 366 s and 10,892 G instructions (error); the two no-whnf tests time out. official v4.35.0: only the two no-whnf timeouts. lean4lean (rank 28) wrongly rejects 7 accept tests with "deterministic timeout", "deep recursion detected", "unknown constant 'Bool.Reflects'".}
}

